      "summaryMarkdown": "S1 passes. **S1-F1 is resolved:** `quality.yml` now adds `--test e2e` to the pinned Clippy job and to the native check matrix, and `WorkflowContractTests.QualityWorkflowPreservesTheQualityMatrices` requires both commands. **S1-F2 is resolved:** `CellRun.ExecuteAsync` writes redacted `artifacts-temp/e2e/<cell>.json` diagnostics for startup exceptions, runner/build exceptions and failed outcomes. `AspireEnvironment` captures resource logs before shutting down after a failed start, fails health waits fast when a resource stops first, and caches a failed start so later cells fail at once instead of waiting out the timeout again. Two new Catalog tests cover this: `CellDiagnosticsTests.FailuresBeforeTheScenarioWriteRedactedDiagnostics` and `VerdictsRequireExactlyOnePassedScenario`. All six S1 checks pass at revision 13. Residual note: the stale `interop-validation` memory rules and state still name `run-interop.ps1` and must be corrected at the S1 memory sync; S3 owns the orphan `src/tests/tests_wasm.rs`.",
